{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MCTS 与 ToT 的结合（LATS）\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">解释蒙特卡洛树搜索（MCTS）的原理，以及它如何与 LLM 的推理过程结合。详细说明 LATS (Language Agent Tree Search) 框架的工作机制。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>MCTS 核心原理</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">蒙特卡洛树搜索（MCTS）是一种启发式搜索算法，通过四个阶段迭代构建搜索树：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>选择（Selection）</strong>：从根节点出发，使用 UCT（Upper Confidence Bound for Trees）公式选择子节点，平衡探索和利用：<br>\n<span class=\"math math-block is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D464 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.345em;\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D441 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-math></mjx-container></span>其中 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">V(s)</code> 是节点价值，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">N(s)</code> 是访问次数，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">p</code> 是父节点，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">w</code> 是探索权重。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>扩展（Expansion）</strong>：到达叶节点后，扩展出一个或多个子节点</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>模拟（Simulation/Rollout）</strong>：从新节点进行随机模拟到终态</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>反向传播（Backpropagation）</strong>：将模拟结果回溯更新路径上所有节点的价值</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>MCTS 与 LLM 的结合</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">传统 MCTS 需要环境模型来模拟动作结果。但 LLM 的特殊之处在于：<strong>可以通过复制粘贴历史文本输入来重置到任意步骤</strong>。这使得 LLM 天然适合 MCTS：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>LLM 作为策略</strong>：指导选择哪个动作/思考</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>LLM 作为评估器</strong>：评估节点的价值</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>LLM 作为世界模型</strong>：预测动作的结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LATS (Language Agent Tree Search) 框架</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LATS 将 MCTS 与 ReAct 结合，统一了推理、行动和规划。核心特点：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">LATS 执行流程:\n1. 在每一步，采样 n 个候选动作（利用 LLM 的生成多样性）\n2. 使用 UCT 公式选择最佳候选\n3. 执行选中的动作，获得 Observation\n4. 用 Observation 评估状态价值\n5. 反向传播更新节点价值\n6. 重复直到任务完成或达到最大搜索深度\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> math\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> random\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LATSNode</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> parent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> parent\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> action\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">uct_score</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> exploration_weight<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">1.414</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'inf'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        exploitation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits\n        exploration <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> exploration_weight <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sqrt<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>log<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> exploitation <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> exploration\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">best_child</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>uct_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LATS</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> num_simulations<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> num_rollouts<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>num_simulations <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> num_simulations\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>num_rollouts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> num_rollouts\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> initial_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_depth<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        root <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> LATSNode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>initial_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>num_simulations<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Selection: 选择最佳路径到叶节点</span>\n            node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_select<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>root<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. Expansion: 扩展子节点</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_get_depth<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> max_depth<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_expand<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. Simulation: 从叶节点模拟</span>\n            reward <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_simulate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. Backpropagation: 反向传播</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_backpropagate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回最佳路径</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_get_best_path<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>root<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_select</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"选择阶段：递归选择 UCT 分数最高的子节点\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>best_child<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> node\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_expand</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"扩展阶段：生成多个候选动作\"\"\"</span>\n        actions <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_actions<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> n<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> action <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> actions<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            child <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> LATSNode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                state<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                parent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                action<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>action\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>child<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> random<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choice<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> node\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_simulate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"模拟阶段：执行动作并评估奖励\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行 action，获取 observation</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            reward <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> reward\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_backpropagate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"反向传播：更新路径上所有节点的价值\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n            node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits\n            node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parent\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_generate_actions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> n<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"使用 LLM 生成 n 个候选动作\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"当前状态: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n请生成 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 个不同的下一步行动:\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> n<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_execute_action</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"input\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Error: Tool not found\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_evaluate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"评估状态价值\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"评估以下结果的质量(0-10): 状态=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, 结果=</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_get_best_path</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> root<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"获取最优路径\"\"\"</span>\n        path <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> root\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            node <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>children<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visits<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>node<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> path\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：LATS 相比 ToT 的优势是什么？答：LATS 使用 MCTS 的 UCT 公式平衡探索和利用，比 BFS/DFS 更智能地分配搜索资源。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：MCTS 中的模拟阶段怎么实现？答：可以用 LLM 自回归生成预测结果，或者对简单环境使用实际交互。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：LATS 的搜索深度和宽度如何权衡？答：取决于任务复杂度，一般搜索深度 3-5，分支因子 3-5，需要结合实际延迟要求调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：MCTS 一定比 BFS/DFS 好。实际上 MCTS 开销更大，简单问题用 BFS/DFS 更快。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：忽视探索权重的调参。UCT 公式中的 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">w</code> 对搜索行为影响很大。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：模拟阶段用真实的 LLM 调用太耗时。可以用轻量模型做快速近似评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}